abstract: >-
  Open-source Python GUI software for the openQCM Q-1 Quartz Crystal
  Microbalance. Displays, processes, and stores resonance frequency and
  dissipation data in real-time through analysis of the resonance curve,
  with support for multiple overtones, auto-tracking, and peak detection
  with phase cross-validation.
